msgstr ""
"Subtrai de cada componente do [Vector2i] os componentes do [Vector2i] "
"fornecido.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector2i(10, 20) - Vector2i(3, 4)) # Imprime (7, 16)\n"
